# S12-T02: Server-Side Presence Registry

## App-agent preflight (MANDATORY before code)

- [ ] MCP preflight: `explain("work-control")` — WS + activity sections
- [ ] Read `server/utils/realtime.ts` — `RoomPeer`, `registerPeer`, `broadcast`
- [ ] Read `server/routes/_ws.ts` — peer lifecycle hooks

## Implementation

Create `apps/work-control/server/utils/presence.ts`:

```ts
// In-memory presence store: room → Set<PresenceMember> (S12-INVARIANTS §1)
// Volatile by design — clears on server restart.
import type { PresenceMember } from '../../shared/ws'

const store = new Map<string, Map<string, PresenceMember>>()
// Map<room, Map<memberId, PresenceMember>>

export function joinRoom(room: string, member: PresenceMember): void
export function leaveRoom(room: string, memberId: string): void
export function updateMember(room: string, member: PresenceMember): void
export function getRoomMembers(room: string): PresenceMember[]
```

- `joinRoom`: upsert member into room Map; rooms created lazily
- `leaveRoom`: remove by `memberId`; delete room entry if empty
- `getRoomMembers`: returns `Array.from(store.get(room)?.values() ?? [])`
- Add `// SEE: feature "work-control" ...` annotation
- No DB writes — all in-memory (invariant §1)

## Done when (app-agent)

- [ ] `bun run test` — unit test for joinRoom / leaveRoom / getRoomMembers
- [ ] `bun run feature:health` — work-control still green
